vpi_mcd_close is PLI_UINT32 (*)(PLI_UINT32): 1
channel 1 is still open
close a|b: 0, close 1|c: 1, close fm: 0, close fd: 0
vpi_mcd_name of fm and fd after the close is NULL: 1 1
a: first line
b: first line
c: first line
c: second line, after a and b were closed
fm: fm: written by $fdisplay
fd: fd: written by $fdisplay
